window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I want him to unleash the beast within him. </b><br> <b>Because only then can I fly free....</b> </p> <p>I crave the darkness. <br> The intimacy with him that would set my heart on fire. <br> Dylan is afraid to let the monster out. <br> His dark past has closed him off. <br> I, too, have scars. <br> But now, he has me wanting something...bad. Wrong. <br> His deep, hypnotizing stare. <br> Those strong arms that might crush me. <br> He hates himself for the things he wants to do to me. <br> But I need to feel free. <br> To be taken in the most forbidden of fantasies. <br> I always knew that I was obsessed. <br> With him. <br> With the monster that he could become. </p> <p><b>But what I didn’t know? </b><br> <b>The terrifying intimacy that comes with exposing yourself so completely.</b></p>"; 
